# many different problems, each caught and shown
me can attempt what
    try
        me call what
    oops why
        say why

me can add_text
    give 1 + yes

me can bad_part
    me has n 5
    give health of n

me can empty_pick
    give me pick (list)

me can bad_csharp
    give me csharp "System.Math" "Sqrt" "a"

me can too_deep
    give item 5 of (list 1 (list 2))

each a in list (action add_text) (action bad_part) (action empty_pick) (action bad_csharp) (action too_deep)
    me attempt a
say "all caught"
